    "description": {
      "content": "The Apache Struts 2 REST Plugin provides RESTful resource-based mapping of HTTP requests to controller actions. URLs follow a convention-based pattern mapping HTTP verbs and URL shapes to controller methods (index, show, create, update, destroy, edit, editNew). This OpenAPI describes the generic URL convention applied to any resource exposed through the plugin.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache Struts",
